
[00:00.00] Call of Silence
[00:00.00] 无声的呼唤

[00:29.30]Don’t you think about me enough?
[00:36.52]I’ve been burning my heart out
[00:43.00]Got to face need to tell you
[00:50.30]I won’t run because I'm reticent
[00:29.30]难道你还不足够了解我吗
[00:36.52]我的整颗心已经燃烧殆尽
[00:43.00]我一定要面对 我要告诉你
[00:50.30]我不会逃避 因为我本就寡言

[01:00.31]You will know you’re reborn tonight
[01:07.32]Must be ragged but I’ll stay by your side
[01:13.59]Even if my body’s bleached to the bones
[01:21.00]I don’t want go through that ever again
[01:00.31]你将明白 今晚你会重生的
[01:07.32]即便会变得支离破碎 但我会在你身边
[01:13.59]即使我粉身碎骨
[01:21.00]我也不愿经历那伤痛

